[00:03.03] Several days a month you made
[00:05.38] The mile to my house
[00:08.13] And had me do a stroll with you
[00:20.10] Far below a furry moon
[00:23.82] Our purposes crossed
[00:26.63] The weird divide
[00:32.58] Between our kinds
[00:57.47] The silver leaves of ailing trees
[00:59.45] Took flights as we passed so long ago
[01:07.80] But a short time I know
[01:13.53] It pleases me this memory
[01:17.97] Has swollen up with age
[01:20.76] Even time can do
[01:25.55] Good things to you
[01:32.93] 